B.auv=new A.cy("Is there a limit on AI analysis?","Yes \u2014 AI analysis uses a cloud model and has daily usage limits to keep the service fast and fair: 20 hand analyses and 5 session analyses per day. Results are cached, so re-opening the same analysis doesn't count against your limit.")
B.aux=new A.cy("How accurate is the AI analysis?","The AI uses a state-of-the-art language model with strong poker fundamentals. It reasons well about common spots but can occasionally misjudge niche or highly exploitative lines. Treat it as a study partner, not an oracle \u2014 it's most useful for identifying patterns and blind spots.")
